        "venue": "Global MBA · Yuan Ze University · 2026",
        "summary": "Builds 21.9M focal patent–technology pair events from citations and IPC subclasses to separate first-time convergence (FTC) from later reactivation (STC). Gompertz, logistic and exponential growth models are fitted on 1976–2019 and tested on an untouched 2020–2025 holdout.",
